    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'Descent' sounds so... heavy. So gradual and exhausting. I don't want to spend the next twenty years watching myself become a shadow of who I am today. Would it be so wrong to want to stay exactly as I am right now? At the peak? To just... stop before the decay sets in?",
